@startuml cu83
!theme plain
title CU83 — Definir Workflow de Estados y Transiciones

actor "Administrator (Administrador)" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The administrator creates a new WorkflowDefinition and associates it with one or more ProcedureType records.
System -> System : Administrator
Actor -> Actor : The system records the definition and enables graph editing.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The administrator adds WorkflowNodes, each linked to an existing ManagementStatus.
System -> System : Administrator
Actor -> Actor : Marks the initial node and the final node or nodes.
System -> System : Administrator
Actor -> Actor : The administrator adds directed WorkflowTransitions between nodes, optionally with a condition.
System -> System : Administrator
Actor -> Actor : The administrator requests workflow validation.
System -> System : Administrator
Actor -> Actor : The system checks graph consistency (a single initial node, and a reachable FINAL node).
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The system persists the validated definition, available for managements of the associated procedure type.
System -> System : System

@enduml
